# No application secrets are required for local D1 or Sites hosting.
# Production storage is the Cloudflare D1 binding named DB, not a browser key.
# Optional integration test target (default http://localhost:8787):
# BASE_URL=https://your-production-domain.example
# For direct Cloudflare deployment, authenticate with `npx wrangler login`.
# Never commit credentials, .dev.vars, local database files, or proposal access links.
